<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Mesopelagic Anglers Fishing Charters</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Private Cebu sportfishing charters from Hadsan Beach Park to the Danajon Bank, Caubian Islands, and deep blue Visayan Sea channels.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #082033;
      --muted: #5b6d7b;
      --line: #d8e4ea;
      --sea: #075d81;
      --deep: #061929;
      --aqua: #00a9ce;
      --orange: #f36f21;
      --green: #2f8d68;
      --mist: #f4f8f9;
      --foam: #ffffff;
      --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(6, 25, 41, .16);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: var(--foam);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button, input, select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0 0 auto;
      z-index: 20;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding: 14px clamp(18px, 4vw, 56px);
      color: var(--foam);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6, 25, 41, .86), rgba(6, 25, 41, .42));
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      min-width: 0;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .brand img {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    }

    .brand span {
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    nav a {
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      border-color: var(--orange);
    }

    .header-cta,
    .primary-btn,
    .secondary-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 44px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .header-cta,
    .primary-btn {
      color: var(--foam);
      background: var(--orange);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(243, 111, 33, .28);
    }

    .secondary-btn {
      color: var(--foam);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.38);
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 92vh;
      display: grid;
      align-items: end;
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
      color: var(--foam);
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6, 25, 41, .88) 0%, rgba(6, 25, 41, .66) 44%, rgba(6, 25, 41, .2) 100%),
        url("assets/hero-boat.jpeg");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      padding: 110px clamp(18px, 4vw, 56px) 48px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      width: min(760px, 100%);
      padding-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #aeeaff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 34px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--orange);
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px);
      line-height: .95;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 670px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .hero-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(120px, 1fr));
      width: min(860px, 100%);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
      background: rgba(6, 25, 41, .28);
    }

    .hero-stat {
      padding: 18px 16px;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    }

    .hero-stat:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .hero-stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .hero-stat span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.74);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    main section {
      padding: 76px clamp(18px, 4vw, 56px);
    }

    .section-inner {
      width: min(1180px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-heading {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(240px, 420px);
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(31px, 4vw, 54px);
      line-height: 1.02;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .fleet {
      background: var(--mist);
    }

    .fleet-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(320px, .9fr);
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .feature-image {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 8px;
      min-height: 420px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .feature-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .spec-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .spec {
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--foam);
    }

    .spec strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: var(--sea);
      font-size: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .spec p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .sessions {
      background: var(--foam);
    }

    .session-grid,
    .price-grid,
    .grounds-grid,
    .faq-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .session-card,
    .price-card,
    .ground-card,
    .faq-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--foam);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .session-card {
      min-height: 236px;
      padding: 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .session-time {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--sea);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .tag {
      width: fit-content;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      color: var(--deep);
      background: #d8f4ef;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .destinations {
      color: var(--foam);
      background: var(--deep);
    }

    .destinations .section-heading p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    }

    .destinations .section-heading h2 {
      color: var(--foam);
    }

    .map-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .95fr) minmax(320px, 1.05fr);
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .map-frame {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .map-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .ground-card {
      padding: 22px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--foam);
    }

    .ground-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .ground-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .ground-card ul,
    .policy-list {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .ground-card li,
    .policy-list li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 18px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .ground-card li::before,
    .policy-list li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: .7em;
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--orange);
    }

    .price-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .price-card {
      padding: 26px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(8, 32, 51, .08);
    }

    .price-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    .price-table {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .price-table th,
    .price-table td {
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .price-table th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .price-table td:last-child {
      text-align: right;
      color: var(--sea);
      font-weight: 900;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .quote-tool {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--mist);
    }

    .quote-controls {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    label {
      display: grid;
      gap: 7px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    select,
    input {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 46px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--foam);
    }

    .quote-result {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .quote-metric {
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--foam);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .quote-metric span {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .quote-metric strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: var(--sea);
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .inclusions {
      background: var(--mist);
    }

    .inclusion-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(320px, 1.1fr);
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .inclusion-panel {
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 26px;
      color: var(--foam);
      background: var(--sea);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .inclusion-panel p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    }

    .inclusion-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .inclusion-list li {
      min-height: 74px;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--foam);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr .85fr .85fr;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .gallery img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .gallery img:first-child {
      height: 534px;
      grid-row: span 2;
    }

    .faq {
      background: var(--foam);
    }

    .faq-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .faq-item button {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      border: 0;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--foam);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .faq-item button span:last-child {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--sea);
      background: var(--mist);
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      display: none;
      padding: 0 20px 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .faq-item.is-open .faq-answer {
      display: block;
    }

    .booking {
      color: var(--foam);
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6,25,41,.94), rgba(7,93,129,.84)),
        url("assets/boat-trailer.jpeg");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }

    .booking-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 430px);
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .booking h2 {
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 64px);
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .booking p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .booking-panel {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .booking-panel dl {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
    }

    .booking-panel dt {
      color: #aeeaff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .booking-panel dd {
      margin: 4px 0 0;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 34px clamp(18px, 4vw, 56px);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      background: var(--deep);
    }

    footer .section-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      nav {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero-stats,
      .session-grid,
      .grounds-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }

      .section-heading,
      .fleet-layout,
      .map-layout,
      .inclusion-layout,
      .booking-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .price-grid,
      .faq-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      .gallery img:first-child {
        grid-column: span 2;
        height: 360px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .site-header {
        padding: 12px 16px;
      }

      .brand span {
        max-width: 160px;
      }

      .header-cta {
        min-height: 40px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 94vh;
        padding: 96px 18px 28px;
        background-position: 63% center;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: grid;
      }

      .hero-stats,
      .session-grid,
      .grounds-grid,
      .quote-controls,
      .quote-result,
      .inclusion-list,
      .gallery {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-stat {
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      }

      .hero-stat:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      main section {
        padding: 56px 18px;
      }

      .feature-image {
        min-height: 280px;
      }

      .price-table {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .price-table td:last-child {
        white-space: normal;
      }

      .gallery img,
      .gallery img:first-child {
        grid-column: auto;
        height: 280px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Mesopelagic Anglers home">
      <img src="assets/logo.png" alt="">
      <span>Mesopelagic Anglers</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <a href="#fleet">Fleet</a>
      <a href="#sessions">Sessions</a>
      <a href="#grounds">Fishing Grounds</a>
      <a href="#rates">Rates</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="header-cta" href="#book">Book</a>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Private sportfishing charters from Mactan, Cebu</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Mesopelagic Anglers Fishing Charters</h1>
        <p>Run offshore from Hadsan Beach Park aboard a New Zealand-built Extreme 5.7M Game King, targeting the Danajon Bank, Caubian Islands, and deep blue Visayan Sea channels with premium sonar, lights, tackle, and crew.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="primary-btn" href="#rates">View Packages</a>
          <a class="secondary-btn" href="#grounds">Explore Fishing Grounds</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats" aria-label="Charter highlights">
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>4</strong><span>Angler private cap</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>1,800 ft</strong><span>Garmin sonar depth</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>400W</strong><span>Blue night lights</span></div>
          <div class="hero-stat"><strong>14 hr</strong><span>Full-day expedition</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fleet" id="fleet">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>A serious offshore platform for Cebu's deep channels.</h2>
          <p>Built for current, steep drop-offs, and long runs beyond the crowded tourist paths.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fleet-layout">
          <div class="feature-image">
            <img src="assets/boat-trailer.jpeg" alt="Mesopelagic Anglers Extreme 5.7M Game King on its trailer">
          </div>
          <div class="spec-grid">
            <article class="spec">
              <strong>The Vessel</strong>
              <p>New Zealand-built Extreme Boats 5.7M Extreme Game King with heavy-duty aluminum hull, deep-V design, flooded keel stability, and enclosed hardtop.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="spec">
              <strong>The Power</strong>
              <p>Brand new 2026 Yamaha F150FETX four-stroke outboard with 2 x 100AH batteries and a 700W solar generator for electric reels and phone charging.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="spec">
              <strong>The Eyes</strong>
              <p>Garmin ECHOMAP UHD2 92cv paired with GT51M-TM transducer, scanning structure and bait across deep-water contours.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="spec">
              <strong>The Night Shift</strong>
              <p>Custom 400W underwater blue lights attract bait schools and trigger predatory feeding activity directly under the deck.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>The Legendary Danajon Bank</h2>
      <p>One of only six double barrier reef systems on Earth.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ground-card">
      <h3>Welcome to the Twilight Zone</h3>

      <p>
        Mesopelagic Anglers operates in the legendary Danajon Bank,
        a rare double barrier reef system located in the Visayan Sea.
      </p>

      <p>
        Crossing the Middle Pass and Caubian Islands places anglers directly
        above underwater walls, current breaks, seamounts and deep trenches
        holding Giant Trevally, Yellowfin Tuna, Ruby Snapper, Grouper,
        Amberjack, Barracuda and Spanish Mackerel.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
    <section class="sessions" id="sessions">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Choose the feeding window that fits your crew.</h2>
          <p>Departures are timed around tides, light shifts, and productive bite periods.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="session-grid">
          <article class="session-card">
            <span class="tag">Golden hour</span>
            <h3>Morning Session</h3>
            <p>Targets aggressive sunrise surface-feeding pelagics and early current movement.</p>
            <div class="session-time">5:00 AM to 11:00 AM</div>
          </article>
          <article class="session-card">
            <span class="tag">Sunset drift</span>
            <h3>Afternoon Session</h3>
            <p>Late-afternoon bite with a scenic sunset run back to Hadsan Beach Park.</p>
            <div class="session-time">1:00 PM to 7:00 PM</div>
          </article>
          <article class="session-card">
            <span class="tag">Night hunters</span>
            <h3>Nocturnal Session</h3>
            <p>A 12-hour deep-sea marathon built around the 400W underwater blue light array.</p>
            <div class="session-time">5:00 PM to 5:00 AM</div>
          </article>
          <article class="session-card">
            <span class="tag">Best value</span>
            <h3>Full-Day Expedition</h3>
            <p>Fourteen hours spanning both morning and afternoon bites, with the afternoon portion discounted.</p>
            <div class="session-time">5:00 AM to 7:00 PM</div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="destinations" id="grounds">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Fish the Middle Pass, Caubian Islands, and Danajon Bank.</h2>
          <p>Each package is built around different current lines, drop-offs, and offshore target species.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="map-layout">
          <figure class="map-frame">
            <img src="assets/route-map.png" alt="Marine chart showing Lapu-Lapu City, Camotes Sea, and offshore fishing route markers">
          </figure>
          <div class="grounds-grid">
            <article class="ground-card">
              <h3>Caubian Wall</h3>
              <p>Deep drop-offs and current breaks for trophy structure fishing.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Mamsa, Tanguigue, Barracuda</li>
                <li>Shallow jigging and high-speed trolling</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
            <article class="ground-card">
              <h3>Outer Barrier Seamounts</h3>
              <p>Offshore bottom terrain for reef predators and deep-water table fish.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Lapu-Lapu, Ahaan, Katambak</li>
                <li>Slow-pitch vertical jigging</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
            <article class="ground-card">
              <h3>Middle Pass Drift</h3>
              <p>Moving water and bait lanes for schooling jacks and migrating tuna.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Jacks and Yellowfin Tuna</li>
                <li>Light casting and shallow trolling</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
            <article class="ground-card">
              <h3>Deep Blue Danajon</h3>
              <p>The long-range offshore run for serious sportfishing teams.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Yellowfin, Amberjack, Ruby Snapper</li>
                <li>Topwater, trolling, and deep drops</li>
              </ul>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rates" id="rates">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Private rates for up to four anglers.</h2>
          <p>All packages include captain, deckhand, fuel, docking fees, premium tackle, jigs, cooler ice, and media capture.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price-grid">
          <article class="price-card">
            <span class="tag">Tier 1</span>
            <h3>The Middle Pass & Caubian Islands</h3>
            <p>Target Mamsa, trophy Tanguigue, Barracudas, snapper, and grouper around premium reef structure.</p>
            <table class="price-table">
              <thead><tr><th>Session</th><th>Private Rate</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><th>6-hour day session</th><td>₱34,328</td></tr>
                <tr><th>12-hour night session</th><td>₱44,626.40</td></tr>
