          </article>
          <article class="price-card">
            <span class="tag">Tier 2</span>
            <h3>The Deep Blue Danajon Banks</h3>
            <p>The ultimate offshore run for Yellowfin Tuna, Amberjack, Ruby Snapper, Barracuda, and deep reef predators.</p>
            <table class="price-table">
              <thead><tr><th>Session</th><th>Private Rate</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><th>6-hour day session</th><td>₱43,736</td></tr>
                <tr><th>12-hour night session</th><td>₱56,856.80</td></tr>
                <tr><th>14-hour full day</th><td>₱65,604</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="quote-tool" aria-labelledby="quote-title">
          <h3 id="quote-title">Estimate Your Split</h3>
          <div class="quote-controls">
            <label>Package
              <select id="packageSelect">
                <option value="tier1">Tier 1: Middle Pass</option>
                <option value="tier2">Tier 2: Deep Blue Danajon</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Session
              <select id="sessionSelect">
                <option value="day">6-hour day session</option>
                <option value="night">12-hour night session</option>
                <option value="full">14-hour full day</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Anglers
              <input id="anglerInput" type="number" min="1" max="4" value="4">
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="quote-result" aria-live="polite">
            <div class="quote-metric"><span>Total</span><strong id="quoteTotal">₱34,328</strong></div>
            <div class="quote-metric"><span>Per Person</span><strong id="quotePerson">₱8,582</strong></div>
            <div class="quote-metric"><span>50% Deposit</span><strong id="quoteDeposit">₱17,164</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="inclusions" id="included">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="inclusion-layout">
          <div class="inclusion-panel">
            <p class="eyebrow">Everything included</p>
            <h2>Bring food, drinks, and your crew. The boat brings the rest.</h2>
            <p>Each booking includes the offshore platform, marine electronics, crew, tackle armory, fuel coverage, destination fees, media documentation, and cooler ice. Food and beverages are BYO.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="inclusion-list">
            <li>Extreme 5.7M Game King hull and Yamaha F150FETX motor</li>
            <li>Garmin UHD2 92cv with GT51M-TM sonar tracking</li>
            <li>Cannon Uni-Troll 5 ST downrigger for precision trolling</li>
            <li>Shimano, Daiwa, Bullzen, jigs, trolling lures, and electric reel access</li>
            <li>Licensed marine captain and professional fishing deckhand</li>
            <li>GoPro Hero 13 and DJI Osmo Action 4 trip documentation</li>
            <li>Full fuel, docking fees, post-trip washdown, and towing protection</li>
            <li>Raptor 55T cooler packed with fresh ice for drinks and catches</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery" aria-label="Charter gallery">
          <img src="assets/gallery-1.jpeg" alt="Fishing charter equipment and water scene">
          <img src="assets/gallery-2.jpeg" alt="Fishing charter gear detail">
          <img src="assets/gallery-3.jpeg" alt="Fishing charter catch and equipment detail">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section id="armory">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-heading">
